{
  "inShort": "The goal is at risk based on the sprint’s visible evidence. No build or playtest document was shown, so what got done this sprint is unknown. Mia has stopped confirming work, leaving Alex as the only confirmed worker toward the playable slice.",
  "discussed": [
    {
      "itemId": "cmvtjvqa407chnxz8px563av7",
      "text": "The public repository matches the promised Godot demo projects, including import instructions. This closes the repository task, not the playable slice."
    },
    {
      "itemId": "cmvtjvqc007cinxz8malbx2fr",
      "text": "The animated reference video remains done. Inspection found only Big Buck Bunny’s title and thumbnail; the animation was not watched. The sprint’s same video link does not demonstrate sailing or tides."
    },
    {
      "itemId": "cmvtjvqcw07cjnxz8pdhgkj7t",
      "text": "The playtesting article matches the promised reference and closes that task. It explains playtesting, but does not document this team’s five-player test."
    }
  ],
  "notDiscussed": [],
  "outsidePlan": [
    "The devlog reports five players trying the tide loop. That would advance the goal beyond the reference tasks, but no playtest document was available to inspect.",
    "The image captioned “The tide out” shows a mountain landscape. Neither it nor the linked film shows the two islands, tide cycle or co-op sailing."
  ],
  "questions": [
    "Where can the claimed playtest notes be opened, and did those tests include two-player sailing?",
    "What openable build demonstrates both islands, the tide loop and co-op sailing?"
  ]
}

